~~With the reproducer described in https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/85989 and with this PR, the following query works fine~~

```
{
    "size": 1000,
    "_source": false,
    "fields": [
        {
            "field": "name"
        },
        {
            "field": "version"
        }
    ],
    "sort": [
        {
            "_script": {
                "script": {
                    "lang": "painless",
                    "source":"$('version', new Version('0'))"
                },
                "type": "custom",
                "format": "version"
            }
        }
    ]
}
```

~~`"format": "version"` is an addition that would be good to avoid, if we find a way to infer the DocValueFormat from the script~~

